-- 3) 11/05·11/06 시연 고객 확정 예약 중 결제가 없는 예약마다 예약금 결제 1건
INSERT INTO DEPOSIT_PAYMENT (DEPOSIT_PAYMENT_ID, RESERVATION_ID, PG_PROVIDER, PG_TRANSACTION_KEY, STATUS, AMOUNT, REFUNDED_AMOUNT, APPROVED_AT, REFUNDED_AT, CREATED_AT, UPDATED_AT)
SELECT SEQ_DEPOSIT_PAYMENT.NEXTVAL, r.RESERVATION_ID, 'PORTONE', 'imp_demo1105_' || TO_CHAR(r.RESERVATION_ID), 'PAID', r.DEPOSIT, 0, r.CONFIRMED_AT, NULL, r.CREATED_AT, r.CONFIRMED_AT
FROM RESERVATION r JOIN APP_USER u ON u.USER_ID = r.USER_ID
WHERE (u.LOGIN_ID LIKE 'demo170\_c%' ESCAPE '\' OR u.LOGIN_ID LIKE 'demo1105\_c%' ESCAPE '\') AND r.STATUS = 'CONFIRMED'
  AND r.STARTS_AT >= TIMESTAMP '2026-11-05 00:00:00' AND r.STARTS_AT < TIMESTAMP '2026-11-07 00:00:00'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM DEPOSIT_PAYMENT p WHERE p.RESERVATION_ID = r.RESERVATION_ID);

-- 확인용 (실행 후): 매장·날짜별 확정 예약 수
-- SELECT s.NAME, TO_CHAR(r.STARTS_AT, 'MM-DD') D, COUNT(*) FROM RESERVATION r JOIN TREATMENT t ON t.TREATMENT_ID = r.TREATMENT_ID JOIN SHOP s ON s.SHOP_ID = t.SHOP_ID
--  WHERE r.STATUS = 'CONFIRMED' AND r.STARTS_AT >= TIMESTAMP '2026-11-05 00:00:00' AND r.STARTS_AT < TIMESTAMP '2026-11-07 00:00:00'
--  GROUP BY s.NAME, TO_CHAR(r.STARTS_AT, 'MM-DD') ORDER BY 1, 2;
